script = ExtResource("1_jurlb")
day_to_send = 2
sender_name = "Arooj"
displayed_time = "7am"
subject = "Residency"
recipient_name = "Sato Wu-Hara"
contents = "SATO WU-HARA:
Hey Arooj,
How has residency been going? Let me know the next time your online to play some Pankratia!

Arooj: 
Hey dude, 
Med school sucks! It feels like the only free time I have I’m just trying to play video games with Saira, whose now competing in her own tournaments and beating me! We def gotta play up some games with Dre whenever you guys are free!

SATO WU-HARA
Yeah man, just think you’re grinding rn to get that bread whenever it works out Insha’Allah. I know it sucks but keep pushing because soon you’ll be making bank and you’ll be helping people out which is more than I can say for me rn. I’m just serving drinks still. Hopefully the comic works out, but my style is well my style.

AROOJ: 
Bro, what you do matters too. Ya don’t think people come to the cafe for the AI BS, they come for the fact they have a history with what your parents built and like seeing what you’re up to. Plus your drawing’s are dope dude, they’re you, which is the important part. Keep at the reps and eventually you’ll pace out and build something solid. Combo Breaker will hit with the right audience. Insha’Allah our time will come

SATO WU-HARA: 
Appreciate it bro, Insha’Allah it’ll be ours.
"
